@startuml
' UML Component 04c — Composition factory boundary
' Evidence status: Implemented and architecture-guarded.
' Updated: 2026-07-29.

!pragma layout elk
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam PageMargin 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

component "Controller" as Controller #DBEAFE
component "Inbound *Factory contract\nactions/ports/inbound" as Contract #FEF3C7
component "Composition factory\napp/composition/factories" as Factory #F3E8FF
component "Command / Query" as UseCase #FCE7F3
component "Outbound ports" as Ports #FEF3C7
component "Concrete adapters" as Adapters #DCFCE7

Controller -right-> Contract : depends on
Contract -right-> Factory : container binding
Factory -down-> UseCase : constructs + injects
UseCase -right-> Ports : executes through
Ports -right-> Adapters : implemented by

note right of Factory : Construction only — no async workflow, handle()/execute(), transaction, or business ordering

@enduml
